WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:03.660
Hi there. My name is Rick Antezana.

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:07.920
I'm the CEO of Dynamic Language and we help organizations to communicate

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:12.180
in over 200 languages through services like translation, localization,

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.360
interpreting, and a few others.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:19.480
And a few months ago I reached out to Jacques of JCE Media and we were

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:22.200
in need of marketing strategy services.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.820
Essentially, we were doing some marketing activities, but not in really

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:30.800
an organized enough way, and really not in an effective enough way.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.820
And that is definitely what Jacques brought to the table, that the blueprint

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:38.420
that he put together for us was exactly what we needed to move the

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:43.720
needle, to get the leads coming in, to get an organized effort going

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:49.060
for handling all of those leads, and really to make us a better organized

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:52.900
and more attractive organization for others to find and to work with.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:59.280
I wholeheartedly endorse the JCE team and everything that Jacques and

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.080
those guys are doing.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.960
We are currently working with them and we're going to continue to,

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:06.280
just because we really appreciate what they're doing, their effort

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.200
level, their organizational level.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.760
The tools that they use are fantastic and they're great communicators.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.520
So yeah, I really can't say enough positive things about them.

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:16.780
Thanks.
